{
  "sequence_id": "seq_72fdfff4b4353a42",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "They say that if a boy and girl go to see this movie together, they're guaranteed to start dating!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Has there a problem"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Uh... what!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Oh? Presi- dent,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "were you"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "About to invite me to go with you?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "A movie that makes boys and girls who see it start dating..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Are you"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Oh, my"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Going to say that we should see it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "wouldn't that be the same as..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "A Confes- Slow!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Shirogane realizes the dilemma he is in!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "In matters of love, there is an absolute rule that \"The One who Falls in Love Loses!!\""
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "In other words, \"The One who Confesses Loses!!\""
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Both parties, with their incredible pride,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Refuse to allow themselves to be the one to confess!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "What should I do...?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Is my only option to try and trick her to get out of it...?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "For example..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "do... do you want to go sell the tickets with me?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Oh?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You seem rather flustered..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "How cute..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I will not!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I will not run from this!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "You will be the one to flee, Shinomya!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Yes, I was going to invite you, shinomiya."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I don't believe in such rumors,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "And I was under the impression that you didn't either."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Well, Shinomiya?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Do you want to see this movie with me?"
    }
  ],
